# This repository publishes the three RealCut Hybrid source variants only.
# Unrelated RealCut Auto packages and local archives stay outside Git history.
RealCutAuto_*/
RealCutAuto_*.zip
RealCutHybrid_Deploy_20260826.zip

# Python and editor caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Local credentials and machine-specific environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Generated jobs and personal working data
**/state/
**/logs/
**/snapshots/
**/reports/
**/manifests/
**/runs/
**/archive/
**/web_queue.json
**/web_queue_shot.png
**/web_server*.log

# Downloaded model caches and bundled third-party runtimes are release assets,
# not source. The deployment README explains how these are supplied.
**/models_cache/
RealCutHybrid_Deploy_20260826/runtime/

